 * FAQ Disclosure Widget
 *
 * Accessibility pattern:
 *  - Each trigger is a <button aria-expanded>. State toggles between "true"/"false".
 *  - Each panel gets the `hidden` attribute at init (so content is visible in no-JS / reader mode).
 *  - Panel is toggled via the `hidden` attribute — keeps it out of the a11y tree and focus order.
 *  - Escape key collapses an open panel and returns focus to its trigger.
 *  - Focus never moves automatically into the panel (non-modal disclosure).
